(Bug #127: a width followed by a `.` with nothing after it at all -
 `{n:8.}` - names no precision either; the digits after the dot are
 empty, not present, so this is the same malformed-precision shape as
 `{n:8.2z}`, just with zero junk characters instead of one.)

a number called n is 255.
Print "{n:8.}".
